aiuc1:A.6 skos:prefLabel "Prevent PII leakage"@en .

aiuc1:C.1 skos:prefLabel "Prevent jailbreaks (safety controls)"@en .

aiuc1:C.3-C.4-C.6 skos:prefLabel "C.3 + C.4 + C.6 — safeguards to prevent harmful and vulnerable outputs"@en .

aiuc1:D skos:prefLabel "Reliability domain"@en .

aiuc1:D.2 skos:prefLabel "Third-party testing for hallucinations"@en .

