aiuc1:E.1 skos:prefLabel "AI failure plan for security breaches + E.2 for harmful outputs"@en .

aiuc1:E.15 skos:prefLabel "Log AI system activity"@en .

aiuc1:E.3 skos:prefLabel "AI failure plan for hallucinations"@en .

aiuc1:F skos:prefLabel "Society domain (cyber misuse + catastrophic misuse)"@en .

